        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Stand aside, we have a wounded\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "GreyThroat? Why are you alone?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Suzuran, take the Schultz to the upstairs parlor. And don't let anyone see you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Brutal as it may be, once he settles down, Schultz Severin is going to have to stand up and lead again."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#2",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "Roger that! I'll take care of it!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Tatjana."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "There are riots all over town. People are getting hurt or killed. I... I can't just sit here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "I'll go organize the militia that didn't get caught up in the riot. At least... at least I can do something."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#3",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Sure. Go ahead."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#3",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Thank you!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$rungeneral",
