    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock",
        "text": "Halt. At ease."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_053",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior",
        "text": "Yes. We are now just one step away."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_053",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock",
        "text": "One step away from destroying this town."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock",
        "text": "But there is no hope behind us. They cheer for liberation. But all we have freed is their anger and hatred. This is a typical, bloody invasion."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_053",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior",
        "text": "Is it? I don't really care. At this point, a happy ending is out of the question."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_053",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock",
        "text": "This is the last chance... a chance to give them, before we take the last step."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_053",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior",
        "text": "A chance to surrender?"
    },
    {
